- Changes (20240923)
  - Update the kvm/qemu patches to internal build360.

- Changes (20240904)
  - The RBP workaround patch has been removed, necessitating an update
    of the TDX module to at least version UPLR2.

  - Changes in the uAPI between Qemu/KVM necessitate that the edk2 is
    updated to at least commit 9389b9a.

  - The host kexec/kdump functionality has been enabled.
